## Overview

This repository contains lab work for **LAB 3** of the Computer Fundamentals & Career Pathways (CSE103) course.

It demonstrates GitHub collaboration, Git commands, Markdown documentation and API interaction.

## Repository Structure

```text
my_first_repo/
|-- README.md
|-- MARKDOWN_GUIDE.md
|-- CHANGELOG.md
|-- main.py
|-- .gitignore
```

## Skills Demonstrated

| Skill | Status |
|----------------------|-------------|
| Git initialisation | Completed |
| Meaningful commits | Completed |
| Remote push / pull | Completed |
| Markdown docs | Completed |
| API interaction | Completed |

## How to Run

```bash
git clone https://github.com/garima-vashistha/my_first_repo.git

cd my_first_repo

python3 main.py
```

## Key Learning Outcomes

- Configured Git identity and initialised local repositories.
- Created meaningful commits.
- Pushed and pulled changes using GitHub.
- Created structured Markdown documentation.
- Learned basic API interaction.

